foo # a comment after a headword
bar n=12 neg=-5 f=1.5 q="7"

----------------------------------------------------

[
	["headword", "foo"],
	["comment", "# a comment after a headword"],

	["headword", "bar"],
	["attr-name", "n"],
	["operator", "="],
	["number", "12"],
	["attr-name", "neg"],
	["operator", "="],
	["attr-value", "-5"],
	["attr-name", "f"],
	["operator", "="],
	["attr-value", "1.5"],
	["attr-name", "q"],
	["operator", "="],
	["string", "\"7\""]
]

----------------------------------------------------

A # ends a headword. Only all-digit values are numbers; -5 and 1.5 are
strings to the reader.
